lisa-design:
- Series rule (spec, chart owner): only the LAST PR of the ccf-app series edits Chart.yaml (release-app.yaml publishes on any Chart.yaml change on main). HELM-VER-001 is intentionally deferred to the release PR.
- The authz mount is a shared helper (ccf-app.apiAuthzVolumeMount) used by the API container, migrate-db and create-user, so the path cannot drift between them. The apiHasVolumeMounts/apiHasVolumes gate was removed because volumes are now always non-empty.
- wait-for-postgres and generate-public-key do not run the API binary and do not get the mount.
